sub icaron by icaron.ss02;
sub icircumflex by icircumflex.ss02;
sub idieresis by idieresis.ss02;
sub idotbelow by idotbelow.ss02;
sub igrave by igrave.ss02;
sub ihookabove by ihookabove.ss02;
sub imacron by imacron.ss02;
sub iogonek by iogonek.ss02;
sub itilde by itilde.ss02;
sub j by j.ss02;
sub jdotless by jdotless.ss02;
sub jcircumflex by jcircumflex.ss02;
sub l by l.ss02;
sub lacute by lacute.ss02;
sub lcaron by lcaron.ss02;
